      "title": "editcap: add support for epoch timestamps in `-A` and `-B` options",
      "message": "editcap: add support for epoch timestamps in `-A` and `-B` options\n\nTested:\n\nBefore:\n\n```\n$ ./run/editcap -A 1604099720.0 /tmp/in.pcap /tmp/in.after.pcap\neditcap: \"1604099720.0\" isn't a valid date and time\n\n$ ./run/editcap -B 1604099720.0 /tmp/in.pcap /tmp/in.before.pcap\neditcap: \"1604099720.0\" isn't a valid date and time\n```\n\nAfter\n```\n$ ./run/editcap -A 1604099720.0 /tmp/in.pcap /tmp/in.after.pcap\n$ ./run/editcap -B 1604099720.0 /tmp/in.pcap /tmp/in.before.pcap\n```\n\nAlso tested that it works correctly:\n\n```\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |head -2\n1604099671.438871000\n1604099671.887249000\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |tail -2\n1604099745.988632000\n1604099746.227817000\n\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.before.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |head -2\n1604099671.438871000\n1604099671.887249000\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.before.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |tail -2\n1604099719.999725000\n1604099719.999972000\n\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.after.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |head -2\n1604099720.000033000\n1604099720.004247000\n$ tshark -r /tmp/in.after.pcap -n -T fields -e frame.time_epoch |tail -2\n1604099745.988632000\n1604099746.227817000\n```\n",
